zmij -- https://github.com/vitaut/zmij

`src/num/zmij.rs` is a Rust port of zmij, by way of the copy vendored into
Glaze (https://github.com/stephenberry/glaze) as `include/glaze/util/zmij.hpp`.
The shortest round-trip algorithm, the power-of-ten table seeds, and the SWAR
digit split are taken from that work.

